comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T05:47:55.612Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict full all-status corpus and current recurrence glob matcher search have no canonical owner for bounded file-pattern matching. Existing calendar and linked-artifact glob work has a different grammar and surface; retain this enhancement under the live triage lineage."
  "2026-10-13T06:05:29.184Z","harness:codex","Replaced path-pattern backtracking with cached literal/wildcard tokens and two bounded state rows. Eighteen independently declared compatibility cases cover Unicode, punctuation, separators, nullable stars and all four excluded globstar line terminators; long6000-character matching and nonmatching paths with100 stars complete in the same public SDK fixture. Existing256-character pattern and1024-entry cache bounds remain unchanged. Focused suite26 tests passes; full validation is underway."
  "2026-10-13T08:36:54.172Z","harness:codex","Candidate validation: full coverage passes10362 tests with exact100/100/100/100, including26 public recurrence SDK cases. Final Node/Bun/npx/bunx packed workflows and unchanged distribution/runtime budgets pass. The default CLI transport-floor recheck passes all6 operations with unchanged ceilings after one qualified run exceeded create by13ms; retain both observations rather than weakening admission. Seven exact current Semgrep matcher identities await the new full main scan after reviewed delivery. Thirty-two distinct historical Semgrep records were independently reconciled through their own FIXED activity dates under pm-oz8u."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T06:21:01.787Z","harness:codex","The matcher caches compiled tokens under the existing1024-entry eviction policy and uses two state rows per path. This keeps temporary memory proportional to the maximum256-character pattern rather than path length, while preserving the existing trimmed-path and nullable-star semantics."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T06:21:01.119Z","harness:codex","Escaping regex operators and limiting pattern length do not establish a matching-time bound. Preserve a small declared wildcard grammar with bounded state evaluation, and verify literal punctuation, Unicode, separators and line terminators as independent public contracts."
